      "abstract": "In this article, the analytical solutions of economically important model named as the Ivancevic option pricing model (IOPM) along new definition of derivative have been explored. For this purpose, exp a function, extended sinh-Gordon equation expansion (EShGEE) and extended G ′ / G -expansion methods have been utilized. The resulting solutions are dark, bright, dark-bright, periodic, singular, and other kinds of solutions. These solutions are obtained and also verified by a Mathematica tool. Some of the gained results are explained by 2-D, 3-D, and contour plots.",
